{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24490","headline":"见敏中初到邠宁秋日登城楼诗诗中颇多乡思因以寄和 · 白居易","name":"见敏中初到邠宁秋日登城楼诗诗中颇多乡思因以寄和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"想尔到边头，萧条正值秋。\n二年贫御史，八月古邠州。\n丝管闻虽乐，风沙见亦愁。\n望乡心若苦，不用数登楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24490.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24490","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}